{"title":"1968 IMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The 10th <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO\">IMO</a> occurred in 1968 in USSR.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1968 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1968 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1968 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1968 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1968 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1968 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1968 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_IMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\">IMO Problems and Solutions, with authors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017084905\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPrepro